  "statement": "What is the value of \\[ \\begin{aligned} &\\tan^2\\frac{\\pi}{16}\\cdot\\tan^2\\frac{3\\pi}{16} \\\\ &\\quad {}+\\tan^2\\frac{\\pi}{16}\\cdot\\tan^2\\frac{5\\pi}{16} \\\\ &\\quad {}+\\tan^2\\frac{3\\pi}{16}\\cdot\\tan^2\\frac{7\\pi}{16} \\\\ &\\quad {}+\\tan^2\\frac{5\\pi}{16}\\cdot\\tan^2\\frac{7\\pi}{16}? \\end{aligned} \\]",
